{"seq":1,"slug":"eslint-and-biome","title":"ESLint 与 Biome","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/eslint-and-biome","wordCount":593,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"eslint-与-biome\">ESLint 与 Biome</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>静态代码分析是在不执行代码的前提下，通过分析源代码的语法结构和语义信息来发现潜在问题的技术。与运行时错误发现机制不同，静态分析能够在代码编写阶段就捕获问题，极大地缩短了反馈循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    CODE[编写代码] --&gt; LINT[静态分析&lt;br/&gt;ESLint / Biome]&#10;    LINT --&gt; |发现问题| FIX[即时修复]&#10;    LINT --&gt; |通过| COMMIT[提交代码]&#10;    FIX --&gt; CODE&#10;    COMMIT --&gt; CI[CI 流水线&lt;br/&gt;再次检查]\">flowchart LR\n    CODE[编写代码] --&gt; LINT[静态分析&lt;br/&gt;ESLint / Biome]\n    LINT --&gt; |发现问题| FIX[即时修复]\n    LINT --&gt; |通过| COMMIT[提交代码]\n    FIX --&gt; CODE\n    COMMIT --&gt; CI[CI 流水线&lt;br/&gt;再次检查]</pre><p>静态分析能够捕获的问题包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>未使用的变量和导入</li>\n<li>潜在的空引用和类型错误</li>\n<li>不安全的代码模式（如 <code>eval</code>、<code>innerHTML</code>）</li>\n<li>可访问性问题（a11y）</li>\n<li>React Hooks 规则违反</li>\n<li>导入顺序不规范</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"eslint-深度配置\">ESLint 深度配置</h2><p>ESLint 是前端领域使用最广泛的 Linter。ESLint 9 引入了 Flat Config 作为新的配置格式，取代了传统的 <code>.eslintrc</code> 层叠配置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"flat-config-基础\">Flat Config 基础</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// eslint.config.js&#10;import js from &#39;@eslint/js&#39;;&#10;import tsPlugin from &#39;@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin&#39;;&#10;import tsParser from &#39;@typescript-eslint/parser&#39;;&#10;import reactPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-react&#39;;&#10;import reactHooksPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-react-hooks&#39;;&#10;import importPlugin from &#39;eslint-plugin-import&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default [&#10;  js.configs.recommended,&#10;  {&#10;    files: [&#39;**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39;],&#10;    languageOptions: {&#10;      parser: tsParser,&#10;      parserOptions: {&#10;        project: &#39;./tsconfig.json&#39;,&#10;        ecmaFeatures: { jsx: true },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;    plugins: {&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint&#39;: tsPlugin,&#10;      react: reactPlugin,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks&#39;: reactHooksPlugin,&#10;      import: importPlugin,&#10;    },&#10;    rules: {&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars&#39;: [&#39;error&#39;, { argsIgnorePattern: &#39;^_&#39; }],&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@typescript-eslint/strict-boolean-expressions&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks/rules-of-hooks&#39;: &#39;error&#39;,&#10;      &#39;react-hooks/exhaustive-deps&#39;: &#39;warn&#39;,&#10;      &#39;import/order&#39;: [&#10;        &#39;error&#39;,&#10;        {&#10;          groups: [&#39;builtin&#39;, &#39;external&#39;, &#39;internal&#39;, &#39;parent&#39;, &#39;sibling&#39;, &#39;index&#39;],&#10;          &#39;newlines-between&#39;: &#39;always&#39;,&#10;          alphabetize: { order: &#39;asc&#39; },&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    ignores: [&#39;dist/&#39;, &#39;node_modules/&#39;, &#39;.next/&#39;, &#39;*.config.js&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// eslint.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> js </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@eslint/js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tsPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shi